Indicators under the revised Project Document for 2020:
1. Existence of the SDG Climate Facility (0 = no existence; 1 = comparative analysis and options for consideration presented; 2 = Project Board agrees on one option and efforts underway to establish Facility; 3 = the Facility is developed and begins operations)
2. Number of regional strategies and SDG goals against which gaps and opportunities for climate action identified 
3. Level of enhanced understanding of nexus approach to climate action and SDGs (Low = references to SDG-CC nexus is limited; Medium = references to SDG-CC nexus is more frequent in regional discussions/forums; High &#x2013; references to SDG-CC nexus is regular and consistent in various forums)
4. Number of reports and analysis on the linkage between SDG5 and climate action
5. Number of nexus dialogues held with member states, and level of involvement of women, CSOs
6. Minimum percentage of women participants and panelists in regional dialogues on climate action
7. Number of recommendations on climate-nexus presented to the Arab Sustainable Development Committee, the Science and Technology Advisory Group and other regional for a
